### Phase 5 locked design (do not regress without options table)

1. Mechanism: batched `POST .../pulls/{n}/reviews` with `event: COMMENT` (one notification)
2. Anchors: `side: RIGHT` on `HunkDetail.line` / `LineExplanation.line` only — never `ChangedSymbolInfo.line`
3. Bodies: already-computed `detail` + `<!-- focus-line -->` marker
4. ROA: skip `pass_through`; cap `FOCUS_INLINE_MAX` default 8; danger/public first
5. Idempotent: GET review comments → DELETE marker ones → POST fresh review
6. Blast radius / downstream stays in Surface **A** (unchanged files cannot take review comments)
7. Same `pull-requests: write` — no `checks: write`

### Smoke / dogfood recipes

**Phase 5 inline:** On a PR with a real code edit, workflow (or local `post_review_from_env`) should pin captions on changed lines in Files changed; a second sync should replace (not duplicate) marker comments. Pass-through diffs → `skipped`.

**#32 ledger / #33 symbol filter / #34 captions / #37 why-edge / ROA caps:** unchanged recipes from prior handoff.

